  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: System.Drawing has been replaced with Magick.NET. Raster renderers now return MagickImage instead of Bitmap, and colors use MagickColor. Breaking: net35, net40 and netstandard1.3 are no longer supported; .NET Framework 4.7.2+ (including net48) remains supported via netstandard2.0. Adds net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0 targets. See CHANGELOG.md for migration details.",
